ga_V(){return"Kendi her turunun ba\u015f\u0131nda iyile\u015fir."},
ga_W(){return"Ovaling, etki bitene kadar kendi her turunun ba\u015f\u0131nda en y\xfcksek <hp>can\u0131n\u0131n</hp> bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirir."},
ga00(){return"<hp>Can</hp> kayb\u0131ndan \xf6nce hasar\u0131 emer."},
ga01(){return"Kalkan, en y\xfcksek <hp>can\u0131n</hp> bir k\u0131sm\u0131ndan yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir yast\u0131kt\u0131r. Hasar \xf6nce kalkana, sonra <hp>cana</hp> gider. Kalkan\u0131n s\xfcresi yoktur, t\xfckenene kadar kal\u0131r. Her kalkan, bir k\u0131sm\u0131 kald\u0131k\xe7a al\u0131nan t\xfcm hasar\u0131 en az %5 azalt\u0131r. O zaman hasar azaltma simgesi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr."},
ga_B(){return"<hp>Can\u0131</hp> hemen geri verir."},
ga_C(){return"\u0130yile\u015ftirme, hedefin en y\xfcksek <hp>can\u0131n\u0131n</hp> bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 hemen geri verir. <hp>Can</hp> asla maksimumun \xfcst\xfcne \xe7\u0131kmaz."},
