Yt(a){return"Z\u0131rh: yaln\u0131zca kritik vuru\u015flar hasar verir, gerisi seker. Ona kar\u015f\u0131 <crit>kritik \u015fans\u0131n</crit> "+a+" y\xfczde puan\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfckt\xfcr, kesin kritikler her zaman isabet eder."},
YI(a){return"Dokuna\xe7 Tac\u0131: Her dokuna\xe7 vurabilir. Onlar\u0131 kes, krali\xe7e zay\u0131flar. Her turundan sonra her biri %"+a+" \u015fansla vurur."},
YJ(a){return"Yeniden B\xfcy\xfcme: <hp>Can\u0131</hp> ilk kez %"+a+" alt\u0131na d\xfc\u015ft\xfc\u011f\xfcnde bir dokuna\xe7 yeniden \xe7\u0131kar."},
gvW(){return"Ta\u015f Bak\u0131\u015f: bak\u0131\u015f\u0131 en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc Ovaling\u2019ini <fx:petrify>ta\u015fa</fx> \xe7evirir. Onu <fx:heal>iyile\u015ftir</fx> ya da <fx:cleanse>ar\u0131nd\u0131r</fx>, sonra yeniden serbest kal\u0131r."},
